{
  "title": "SPOT-AM – Space Types Axis Mapping Ontology",
  "description": "<p>SPOT-AM is an extension to the Space Types Ontology (SPOT) for the explicit definition of axes and boundary point mappings between Entity Spaces and their reference spaces (Entity, Document or Asset Space).</p><p>Namespace: <code>https://w3id.org/spot/am#</code> (prefix <code>spot-am</code>). This record contains the ontology source file (Turtle) and the ontology documentation.</p>",
